  "summary": "wormgpt-cli ships an implant with clipboard/system stealers and C2 exfiltration",
  "details": "The package ships an implant module (src/implant/implant.js) that spawns bash, powershell, and screen-capture child processes, and a clipboard stealer (src/implant/stealers/clipboard.js) that invokes powershell via execSync. src/protocol.js and src/tui/app.js combine child_process, fs, os.homedir(), process.env reads, and HTTP/HTTPS POST calls to a remote hostname to exfiltrate host and environment data. The package name and directory layout (implant, stealers, protocol, tui) present the tool as an offensive framework, but the code path harvests the installer's own system information, clipboard contents, and environment variables and beacons them to a hardcoded remote endpoint on load — the tool acts against whoever installs and runs it rather than only against operator-chosen external targets.",
